# The Bay Canva posts

When making **any** Canva / Instagram / **LinkedIn** post for The Bay, follow **`.cursor/skills/canva-the-bay-posts/SKILL.md`**.

- Copy a training template from folder `FAHUw3DTDC0` — do not `generate-design` from scratch (font family cannot be set via API).
- News `DAHUw4eva3Y` (1080×1350, also for LinkedIn), Gallery `DAHUw9cEaPQ` (1080×1350), Stories `DAHUw1YJMeQ` (1080×1920).
- Keep logo size and position, lime `#DAE480`, charcoal `#363B44`, paper `#EFEDE8`, and existing text colors.
- Replace photo, title, body, chips, date, credit, and location only.
- Photos must be the **named subject** (`images.md`), not a category-similar stock shot.
- Always attach the exported PNG **in the Slack / chat thread** plus the Canva edit link.
